Package: flexyBayesOrchestra
Title: Constellation Glue for 'flexyBayes': Surrogates, Ensembles and
    Derived Priors
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Max", "Moldovan", email = "max.moldovan@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9680-8474"))
Description: Companion to the 'flexyBayes' Bayesian mixed-model engine that
    supplies the orchestra-composition layer: cheap surrogate emulators of
    expensive fits, ensemble-source ingestion and verification,
    ensemble-derived priors, posterior predictive checks for surrogates,
    and the koine fourth-opinion lens-axis backend for triangulation. Depends
    on 'flexyBayes' for the core model representation and emits results in the
    same shapes.
